(wire (pts (xy 548.64 147.32) (xy 543.56 147.32)) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (uuid "af18bcd1-faae-4e37-bf18-000000000134"))
(label "FUSED_RAW" (at 543.56 147.32 0) (effects (font (size 1 1))) (uuid "af18bcd1-faae-4e37-bf18-000000000135"))
(text "V1.8 OVP CANDIDATE: IRF9540N P-CH high-side source FUSED_RAW / drain OVP_SWITCHED -> D701 ANODE2.\nLM393N (U801) uses TL431BCLP 2.5V (U802) and 56k2/10k divider. R804=100k R805=1Meg nominal hysteresis.\nQ802 pulls gate low only when VREF valid and comparator releases; R808 gate-source defaults OFF.\nD803 1N4742A 12V clamps |VGS|. Threshold nominal approx 16.52V rising / 15.02V falling, NO vendor/load model proof.\nLM393 raw input must stay within MAX 36V; continuous high-voltage and source energy still unsafe. NO FAB / NO TX." (at 203.2 402.59 0) (effects (font (size 1 1))) (uuid "af18bcd1-faae-4e37-bf18-000000000136"))
